iate"><addressbook><name>SAITO, MASATO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMASHITA, YOSHIKUNI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A pack preparation comprising a water-soluble polymer and a saxifrage extract. The pack preparation is reduced in irritation and ache during peeling, and gives a firm and moist skin feeling after use. It is excellent in suitability for remoistening, quick-drying properties, and convenience.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une préparation de compresse, comprenant un polymère hydrosoluble et un extrait de saxifrage. Lorsqu'elle est enlevée, ladite préparation est moins irritante et moins douloureuse et procure une sensation d'hydratation et de raffermissement après usage. Elle présente d'excellentes propriétés de réhydratation, de séchage rapide et est pratique à utiliser.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>